WEBVTT

00:01:59.796 --> 00:02:02.276
to look after my sister and her two boys.

00:02:03.116 --> 00:02:06.636
A few weeks later, on Tuesday, May 19,

00:02:06.636 --> 00:02:08.796
Trudy collapsed suddenly at home.

00:02:09.476 --> 00:02:11.276
Despite trying CPR,

00:02:11.276 --> 00:02:13.996
she died in my arms
before the ambulance arrived.

00:02:14.956 --> 00:02:16.236
She was 45.

00:02:18.396 --> 00:02:21.436
After some very emotional
goodbyes to family,

00:02:21.476 --> 00:02:23.676
the only thing certain
in my immediate future

00:02:23.716 --> 00:02:25.436
was 14 days in quarantine.

00:02:26.476 --> 00:02:27.956
But before I got on that plane,

00:02:27.956 --> 00:02:30.636
I gave my nephews
an extra special uncle-Dom hug.